# Local environment. No model provider key exists in this project and no code
# path may expect one (CLAUDE.md rule 3). This is here to catch a stray local
# override, not to make room for a secret.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Committed on purpose. Do not add these, however generated they look.
#
#   frontend/src/types/events.schema.json   written by scripts/export_schema.py
#   frontend/src/types/events.ts            written by npm run gen:types
#     Generated, never hand-edited, and tracked so a contract change shows up as
#     a reviewable diff. Ignoring them means a fresh checkout cannot typecheck
#     until someone remembers to run `python tasks.py types`.
#
#   frontend/package-lock.json              pinned dependency tree
#   backend/uv.lock                         pinned dependency tree, once uv runs
#     here. See the Commands section of CLAUDE.md.
#
#   backend/data/*.csv                      the bundled dataset, from phase 1
#     Generated by scripts/generate_data.py and committed with its deliberate
#     defects intact. The demo reads these exact files; regenerating them at
#     run time would change every number on the dashboard.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
